			<!-- 4. Cloak of Protection -->
				<node id="GameObjects">
					<!-- Wizards Otiluke and Bigby may be renowned as dignified members of the Circle of Eight, but on one occasion, as younger men, Bigby bet Otiluke that he couldn't suck thirteen litres of vodka out of a protection cloak like this one.<br><br>Bigby won.  -->
